Normal words are also fed into the  vectorizers : 

within the dictionary there are a few anomalies which are documents decsribing noise:


![BOW-NORMAL](https://github.com/provallo-com/provallo_nginx_extension/blob/main/vectorizer_fuzzdb_benignLDA_VECTORIZER3.gnuplot_bow_cloud.gnuplot_bow.gif)

 






each pipeline trains several models and generate accuracy matrices such as ROC curves and confusion matrices, confusion matrices are plotted using gnuplot and can be configured to display the precise weight or labels of the predictions asocciated with the diagonal truth 


for example, famous UCI dataset https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/50/image+segmentation  :
![confusion](https://github.com/provallo-com/provallo_nginx_extension/blob/main/softmax_test_confusion_matrix_segment.png?raw=true)

or for dynamically created datasets 
![confusion](https://github.com/provallo-com/provallo_nginx_extension/blob/main/provallo_net_confusion_matrix.png?raw=true)

![confusion](https://github.com/provallo-com/provallo_nginx_extension/blob/main/web_requests_confusion_matrix.png?raw=true)


The currently best performing models are autoencoded softmax , where the softmax contains an autoencoder with symmetric input output and hidden in addition to internal mapping of the softmax/softplus to the edges 


bit-binary transposed models are experimental , and pipeline's transitional AI under development.




